00:55:05.100 --> 00:55:06.020
One hundred quid.

00:55:08.780 --> 00:55:11.600
You ain't in such a cushy spot after all, like Harry.

00:55:12.260 --> 00:55:14.340
You really need the Strangler, don't you?

00:55:15.140 --> 00:55:16.420
Two hundred quid, Harry.

00:55:18.120 --> 00:55:18.780
All right, all right.

00:55:18.900 --> 00:55:19.520
Two hundred it is.

