Crush me! Beard! Beard! Take your boy in my office.

00:58:17.480 --> 00:58:25.180
I'll be in in a minute. Gregorius, it's the only way. We'll let Nicholas finish him and his

00:58:25.180 --> 00:58:27.360
whole cheap circus, once and for all.

00:58:30.540 --> 00:58:32.040
Once and for all.

00:58:38.280 --> 00:58:43.700
You're sensational.

00:58:44.660 --> 00:58:45.260
You're a wonder.

00:58:45.910 --> 00:58:46.990
