01:00:15.300 --> 01:00:15.740
Sure.

01:00:16.600 --> 01:00:20.660
Hello. Mr. Nosferous here. I want to talk to Mr. Christenberry.

01:00:22.710 --> 01:00:23.070
Thank you.

01:00:28.540 --> 01:00:29.020
Yes, dear.

01:00:30.800 --> 01:00:35.020
There comes a time when a lad must learn the true facts of life and death.

01:00:35.670 --> 01:00:37.150
Well, dear boy, your time has come.

01:00:37.890 --> 01:00:38.510
What do you say?

01:00:40.430 --> 01:00:42.350
You see, Christo and I are old friends.

01:00:42.960 --> 01:00:46.180
Consequently, I feel it my duty to tell him about the Strangler.

01:00:46.460 --> 01:00:47.220
What do you say?

01:00:47.780 --> 01:00:51.860
I'm saying that nobody, nobody cuts in on Philip Nosferens.

01:00:52.630 --> 01:00:53.410
No, dear boy.

01:00:53.650 --> 01:00:55.740
