01:00:56.320 --> 01:00:58.780
I am giving you the sharp edge of the knife.

01:00:59.540 --> 01:00:59.760
Hello?

01:01:00.410 --> 01:01:00.910
Why, wait.

01:01:03.000 --> 01:01:03.960
