01:01:08.480 --> 01:01:09.240
Because you're a thief.

01:01:10.070 --> 01:01:11.730
You tried to steal something from me.

01:01:12.970 --> 01:01:13.190
Helen?

01:01:15.140 --> 01:01:15.280
Helen?

01:01:15.540 --> 01:01:18.370
