01:01:18.430 --> 01:01:18.710
It's crazy.

01:01:18.870 --> 01:01:19.410
Put down that phone.

01:01:19.470 --> 01:01:20.270
Put that phone down.

01:01:20.950 --> 01:01:21.650
I don't want Helen.

01:01:21.770 --> 01:01:22.770
