01:01:22.850 --> 01:01:23.110
Nothing.

01:01:23.430 --> 01:01:24.530
She gave you the money.

01:01:27.440 --> 01:01:29.600
But I took it because I was desperate, Phil.

01:01:29.720 --> 01:01:29.960
You wouldn't...

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:33.740
Listen to me, remember? But I didn't cross you, Phil. I played it straight with you.

01:01:34.620 --> 01:01:38.500
Hello? Oh, well, find him, please. It's very urgent.

01:01:39.370 --> 01:01:42.850
Tell him to go at once to Fabian's gymnasium. He'll find the strangler there.

01:01:44.690 --> 01:01:44.990
Phil!

01:01:46.720 --> 01:01:50.330
