01:04:53.730 --> 01:04:54.530
Where can I drop you?

01:04:54.570 --> 01:04:55.470
I've got to go to Harry.

01:04:55.710 --> 01:04:56.670
I'm afraid he's in trouble.

01:04:56.870 --> 01:04:59.650
