01:05:37.160 --> 01:05:38.640
You're killing me and yourself.

01:05:40.690 --> 01:05:43.360
I beg you, I beg you, don't do it to Miss Harriton.

01:05:44.340 --> 01:05:45.160
Hurry, don't!

01:05:47.460 --> 01:05:48.760
Not money you're taking.

01:05:50.110 --> 01:05:51.030
I won't let you do it.

01:05:52.870 --> 01:05:53.390
I won't do it!

01:06:01.120 --> 01:06:03.140
Now listen to Papa. He knows what is good for you.

01:06:06.790 --> 01:06:10.130
