01:06:40.220 --> 01:06:41.600
Maybe I should have a cut of it.

01:06:42.110 --> 01:06:43.090
Maybe you need a manager.

01:06:44.590 --> 01:06:45.050
Sign.

01:06:51.180 --> 01:06:52.100
Get out!

01:06:52.590 --> 01:06:53.770
Go teach a woman!

01:06:54.140 --> 01:06:55.440
I crush you like...

01:06:55.440 --> 01:06:55.900
No way!

01:06:55.900 --> 01:06:57.560
I break you on my chicken ball!

01:06:57.620 --> 01:06:58.580
Yeah, that's enough of that!

01:06:58.860 --> 01:06:59.900
Get behind old man!

