We gotta stop him.

01:08:00.000 --> 01:08:00.840
I gotta stop him!

01:08:01.180 --> 01:08:02.020
I can't.

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:30.920
Keep out of that cape!

01:08:34.480 --> 01:08:40.260
