01:08:49.180 --> 01:08:49.900
Don't let it go!

01:08:50.080 --> 01:08:50.580
Hold on!

01:08:51.950 --> 01:08:52.510
Hold on!

01:09:40.940 --> 01:09:46.440
What I do to your clowns?

01:10:41.740 --> 01:10:42.100
Great.

01:10:53.836 --> 01:10:54.836
Please lie down.

