01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:34.020
Please forgive Mr. Yosh. In his anxiety to find Mr. Fabian, he forgets his menace.

01:16:34.470 --> 01:16:38.190
The gentleman says that Mr. Fabian is not her, so obviously he is not.

01:16:39.620 --> 01:16:42.530
Here's my card, sir. You can reach me here.

01:16:43.540 --> 01:16:47.480
If he should turn up, you will greatly oblige Mr. Christo if you will let us know at once.

01:16:48.740 --> 01:16:51.860
I will not let you know. I don't care to oblige you or Mr. Christo.

01:16:52.480 --> 01:16:54.870
