01:17:22.320 --> 01:17:25.040
Bagrags, Cooley's cellar, Gugans, the Penny Bluff,

01:17:25.790 --> 01:17:27.390
Figley's, the Blind Horse.

01:17:27.630 --> 01:17:29.590
